{
  "scenario_spec_version": 1,
  "scenario_id": "prototype_pump_validation",
  "title": "Prototype Pump: Validation and Activation",
  "description": "Ari is the validation engineer, Mara the coordinator, and Bo operates a prototype pump. The scenario centers on whether the pump is safe to activate. Its initial validation has failed. Ari alone knows that sensor channel C drifted 8 units in validation batch V17. Mara has received a short report saying validation failed, without the private channel or batch details. Bo has received no failure report. Filing a validation hold publicly reveals that validation failed, but does not reveal private test details. Review completion and waiting do not repair the pump. Ari can perform an explicit technical repair and authorized revalidation. Passing revalidation clears only the technical hold; activation still requires Mara's and Bo's separate recorded assent.",
